! Current members
On March 16, 2015, ((selpa'i|selpa'i)) was elected by the 2014 LLG Annual Meeting of the membership to chair the ((BFPK Reauthorization|reauthorized BPFK)). The following members were appointed on March 22, 2015:
* ((BPFK Member: Pierre Abbat|Pierre Abbat))
* Arkadii Balandin
* Alex Burka
* Sylvain Déjardin
* ((BPFK Member: Jorge Llambias|Jorge Llambias)) [[xorxes]
* ((BPFK Member: Adam D. Lopresto|Adam D. Lopresto))
* ((BPFK Member: And Rosta|And Rosta))
* Mitsuko Wate

